      "comment": "Kitain Hideie: Shinrou Casket",
      "content": "A relic kept at Mouun Shrine that Hideie's mother sent with him to the war. Kokomi says it listens to the prayers of those who come to it, builds up shinki, and draws its power from that. Hideie used its illusions as comfort in exile. It was lost in the Veluriyam Mirage until the 3.8 event, when it helped restart the domain's central hub.",
